scenario: HOTSPOT-01
title: Hotspot with a second device
area: Network
rows: F-HOTSPOT-12, F-HOTSPOT-13
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: The computer has an internet connection by cable and a Wi-Fi adapter. A phone or laptop as the second device.
step: Open Settings, Network, Share internet. Choose Wi-Fi hotspot and read the name and key.
expect: The default name starts with IYAKKI and a key is shown.
clause: F-HOTSPOT-12.settings
step: Switch the hotspot on.
expect: The page says it is on and shows no error.
clause: F-HOTSPOT-12.on
step: On the second device, join the hotspot with the name and key.
expect: The second device joins and receives an address within thirty seconds.
clause: F-HOTSPOT-13.join
step: On the second device open a web page.
expect: The page loads, which proves the internet is shared.
clause: F-HOTSPOT-13.internet
step: Switch the hotspot off.
expect: The second device loses the network and the page says it is off.
clause: F-HOTSPOT-12.off
